Then the bot downloads EV form and .rtf files associated to all ICSRs related to Menarini’s products and send emails to DSUs for final case validation.', '42', 'In production', '5', '7', '2020-11-04', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/0AJlgtVxk1GYjUk9PVA'),
('143', 'RPA - Double Doctor Management', 'rpa - double doctor management', 'When in the Menarini’s global DB of doctors and pharmacists is added a new record having FC equal to one or more existing records, the automation has to keep only one active doctor or pharmacist (main doctor), aggregating all info and dismissing duplicate records.', '44', 'In production', '5', '7', '2021-03-12', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/0AJ1fsQBQT_jpUk9PVA'),
('144', 'RPA - Supply Chain APO Permissions', 'rpa - supply chain apo permissions', 'For each new supply chain flow, the robot assigns appropriate permissions to interested active users, deletes the permissions that already exist and uploads the updated authorization file in SAP.', '45', 'In production', '5', '7', '2021-07-01', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1yMrFVbZuvJQ2fBvFzbDHbN9lIjLXJIRf'),
('145', 'RPA - Supply Chain Amendment Reminder', 'rpa - supply chain amendment reminder', 'An affiliate can request to change an order. These changes create an amendment (a workflow) in SAP APO (Advanced Planner and Optimizer) between the affiliate, manufacturer and/or logistic. The stakeholders must answer to the amendment, in order to close it. The amendments must be closed within a short period, since they create discontinuity of the production. The user checks on APO if there are amendments with status "Open" or "To be confirmed". Depending on the status, a reminder must be sent to the interested contact person.

The end-to-end process takes 2 hours every time it is done. The process should be done every day, in order to reduce the impact on the production.', '45', 'In production', '5', '7', '2021-07-01', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/10d14vDf7iTTJwQgTzSomt09H8ZQkQLzZ'),
('146', 'RPA - Check Opened Return Deliveries', 'rpa - check opened return deliveries', 'The process starts with the extraction from SAP of the list of all diagnostics deliveries using dedicated SAP variants. The information extracted from SAP is stored in an Excel file. There are two Excel templates: the first one for ZRE/ZRHO (only warehouses), and the second one for all other cases. Finally, the Excel file is sent to dedicated users.', '39', 'In production', '6', '7', '2021-09-01', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1uqPL3VG2WI74840cSLT62CM7aZaOgbWh'),
('164', 'RPA - Sconto Merce and Supero Valore Orders', 'rpa - sconto merce and supero valore orders', 'Every day, the automation extracts form SAP the list of orders having a block “Sconto Merce” or “Supero Valore”, downloading related pdf files. For each order that has not been processed previously, the bot sends and email to the related business users.', '48', 'In production', '6', '7', '2023-01-26', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1mjzkkITFb2R0CqYJ8FqzqoYTjUy1KEBp'),
('147', 'RPA - Checking of Double Orders', 'rpa - checking of double orders', 'On a daily basis DW extracts from SAP a list of all orders having a ‘Double Order within Month’ or ‘Duplicated Order’ block. Then the bot retrieves from SAP information relative to the order, previously processed, having the same client, product number and the delivery date within the same month to the blocked order. Based on the user that created the blocked order, the DW sends two different types of emails: directors and/or contact person.', '39', 'In production', '6', '7', '2021-09-05', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1hJ4eptG34NCnZ_Fn9Usojzi6q_DFl6fS'),
('149', 'RPA - Unlocking Fuori Canvass', 'rpa - unlocking fuori canvass', 'On a daily basis a robot extracts from SAP the list of MIS and OCR-ICR orders having a block ‘Fuori Canvass’. The extracted orders are sent to directors in charge and once verified, they send a communication to the back office users asking for unlocking or revoking the specific order.', '39', 'In production', '6', '7', '2021-11-05', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1VP7uqlpbvrx9kkaNi9y4snhAYVqnjxeU'),
('150', 'RPA - Uploading of documents in Archiflow', 'rpa - uploading of documents in archiflow', 'For all international sales, DW stored riceived documents as attachments to a specific invoice in Archiflow. Once the Movement Reference Number (MRN) notification is received, the bot  uploads it in Archiflow and associates it with all the related invoices.', '39', 'In production', '6', '7', '2021-11-05', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1ZEdYV3ADeg6LM6NsvgJz9cMxjmkx3cee'),
('151', 'RPA - Revoking Pos', 'rpa - revoking pos', 'On a daily basis DW extracts from SAP the list of orders having specific  ‘Sold to party’ values and for each order verifies that the payment condition is the same as the one saved in SAP master data. If some inconsistencies occur, the bot revokes the order and sends a notification to the person that created the order.', '39', 'In production', '6', '7', '2021-11-08', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1xmiOeqJfV9ch5ZCt7wwr7F0478K9gXrX'),
('152', 'RPA - Unlocking P2P Invoices', 'rpa - unlocking p2p invoices', 'The Digital Worker must send an approval email to the invoice approvers and proceed to release the invoice payment in the P2P system after receiving an email response from the approvers.
The invoices arriving in P2P for approval are exclusively Italian electronic invoices, either unordered or with discrepancies.', '47', 'In production', '5', '7', '2022-07-08', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1Z9vN4XpYpmtHYpWqCJKl7KSboSnnjJkh'),
('153', 'RPA - MOC', 'rpa - moc', 'The robot downloads data from SAP APO to create and send MOC alert reports to dedicated actors in order to monitor all significant deviations according to a safety stock threshold specified by business.', '45', 'In production', '5', '7', '2022-07-14', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1Tz3U4vl9PHxs-ffJyW7iev3O3Aoafem3'),
('154', 'RPA - Download PDF Supervisor', 'rpa - download pdf supervisor', 'Two times a day, DW downloads from the Supervisor website the list of all orders, identify all orders that have been created after the last processing. For these orders the bot downloads the associated pdf files, then send them and the Excel file to dedicated users.​', '48', 'In production', '6', '7', '2022-09-13', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/15v7mVZPcTBzZe-YG9zLGdSfs6BtKi6Yp'),
('155', 'RPA - Opened Deliveries Pharma', 'rpa - opened deliveries pharma', 'On a daily basis the bot extracts from SAP the list of all return deliveries that have been created two days before the current date. Return deliveries in scope are "vendita" and "campionatura". The information extracted is stored in an Excel file, formatted and sent to the final users.', '39', 'In production', '6', '7', '2022-09-13', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1lA7-S1Rx0Y7dOVLmtKtPDYHn2rLdMYFR'),
('156', 'RPA - Uploading Purchase Orders in SAP', 'rpa - uploading purchase orders in sap', 'For each order, the automation extracts from the .pdf file all necessary information needed to successfully complete the entire process. Before proceeding with the creation or modification of an order, it is necessary to verify that it is not already present in SAP. The modification of an order can only affect the quantity or the delivery date of a product.', '41', 'In production', '6', '7', '2022-09-13', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1XIbvFGzsCmG7sQPsGdRKa8VqEFamjsFz'),
('157', 'RPA - Entering Spare Parts Orders', 'rpa - entering spare parts orders', 'On a daily basis the DW downloads from the MD portal list of all tickets that have been opened during the previous working day. All retrieved tickets have to be imported in SAP, performing, when possible, the movement of the materials between the warehouses.', '40', 'In production', '6', '7', '2022-09-21', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1ncoNKNKqUyRPEyXOxDP60pN48UQE6hX1'),
('158', 'RPA - Anti-mafia Declaration', 'rpa - anti-mafia declaration', 'Every 6 months the DW sends an email with templates of both anti-mafia declaration and self-certification of pending charges to a list of executives.', '49', 'In production', '6', '7', '2022-10-06', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1knHdaXphc3sAc0__TEQ_sYMQ9ncwaGJd'),
('159', 'RPA - Net Value Orders', 'rpa - net value orders', 'On a daily basis a list of all orders having a ‘Minimum and Max Order Net Value’ block is extracted from SAP, retrieving information related to the order and extract the pdf of the order. At the end of the process, th automation sends an email to Directors. Process will be done for Codifi (internal) ‘Net Value’ orders for which the communication is sent to Codifi director.', '39', 'In production', '6', '7', '2022-10-13', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1GfyLHRZbXe1SjjNFdjAWQ9kQ-KlF_vuw'),
('160', 'RPA - Opened Deliveries Diagnostics', 'rpa - opened deliveries diagnostics', 'Every two days the DW extracts from SAP the list of all diagnostics return deliveries. The information extracted is stored in an Excel file. Afterwards, the file is formatted with a new columns and sent to the final users.​', '48', 'In production', '6', '7', '2022-10-27', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1Cm49tGHkPO-IujfiNsx38mzf5RrQbeUH'),
('161', 'RPA - DDT and Tag Emission', 'rpa - ddt and tag emission', 'Every day, the automation retrieves all emails containing a request for the promotional materials. After having extracted all information for creating DDTs and Tags from the email body, the bot perform data entry in AS400 without doing any transcoding. In the end they save the  DDT/Tag and automatically the printing job starts.', '40', 'In production', '6', '7', '2022-11-25', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1TfdMdymCq_sEAYMmKoAExsTQjR9Wkr_x'),
('162', 'RPA - Serialization EU Alert tool', 'rpa - serialization eu alert tool', 'The robot retrieves and processes all daily EMVO L5 alerts to address alert''s root cause and communicates them to dedicated users. Then, a final report are created and saved in the dedicated Drive.', '42', 'In production', '5', NULL, '2023-01-13', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/0ADq0Io6WKFe2Uk9PVA'),
('165', 'RPA - Storage invoices documents in Archiflow', 'rpa - storage invoices documents in archiflow', 'On a daily basis, the automation downloads from Salesforce documentation regarding credit notes. At first, analyzing credit notes and then identify the invoice they are related to. Afterwards, the bot uploads in Archiflow all downloaded documents related to the corresponding invoice.', '50', 'In production', '6', '7', '2023-07-12', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1aNjm6VIuUac-s2j9lDZ4Orv0TFDdsDwj'),
('166', 'RPA - Revoking of acc. blocked orders', 'rpa - revoking of acc. blocked orders', 'On a daily basis, DW launches the transaction ZSD046 to revoke all retrieved orders.', '39', 'In production', '6', '7', '2023-07-26', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1PTIRS1csnAEwG8YZpyz36K6K7fozOAcP'),
('167', 'RPA - Checking orders in Supervisor', 'rpa - checking orders in supervisor', 'Three times a day, business users download from Supervisor all .pdf files related to new orders. For each .pdf file, the bot verifies if products Vaborem and/or Tenkasi are present and checks if there are new Stemline orders on Supervisor. In the end, an email containing identified orders has to be sent to the Order Management office.', '39', 'In production', '6', '7', '2023-09-12', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1NIPLLl8poNLn3sf99972BhuO4UGp2LPI'),
('168', 'RPA - Shipping tracking', 'rpa - shipping tracking', 'On a daily basis, the bot tracks EU shippings checking DHL and TNT websites. If the shipping ends, the automation downloads the associated .pdf file and upload it in Archiflow in the dedicated invoice folder. Furthermore, the DW logs in in SAP (transaction ZSD098) and flag the field CMR/POD corresponding to the processed shipping.', '41', 'In production', '6', '7', '2023-10-02', 't', '2026-08-24 12:52:57.444284+00', 'https://drive.google.com/drive/u/0/folders/1E7u4CzamB6ogfFGC8iwmtcnWo8kzV9-D');


